# Cross PC AI does NOT require a .env file to run — the setup wizard configures
# your Anthropic API key at runtime and stores it encrypted on-device.
#
# These two are only needed if you're rebuilding the app after provisioning your
# own Supabase project for the Cross PC Sync ($15/mo) feature. They are public,
# non-secret values (protected by Postgres Row Level Security), baked into the
# build via Vite — see src/shared/constants.ts.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# The following are NOT used by this app directly — they belong to the Supabase
# Edge Functions in supabase/functions/, set as Edge Function secrets in the
# Supabase dashboard (Project Settings -> Edge Functions -> Secrets), never in
# this file or anywhere in the desktop app:
#   STRIPE_SECRET_KEY, STRIPE_PRICE_ID, STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET,
#   SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY
